    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Lufthansa Business Class\nMenu",
      "Lufthansa Business Class\n• Lufthansa Business Class\nDinner\nBreakfast\nHors d'oeuvre\nRoasted Beef Tenderloin\nenhanced by Red Chili Coulis\nwith an Asparagus and Bean Medley\nSeafood Salad\noffered with Pink Grapefruit\nFresh Fruit\nRoll and Croissant\nwith Butter and Preserves\nA variety of Cold Cuts\nfeaturing smoked Turkey Breast,\nCamembert and Swiss Cheese\nSalad\nSeasonal Greens\npresented with Dressing\nBread, Rolls and Butter\nEntrees\nOmelette\nVegetable Frittata\nEntrees\nSautéed Shrimp in herbed Lemon Butter\ncomplemented by Broccoli with Almonds\nand White Rice\nRoasted Breast of Duck\nwith Parsnip Puree and Snow Peas\nRavioli filled with Cheese\naccented by Pomodoro Sauce\nand grilled Roma Tomatoes\nLast Minute\nBreakfast\nCoffee or Tea\nOrange Juice\nCroissants\nCheese and Dessert\nCheddar, Manchego and Cambozola Cheese\nStrawberry Crumb Cake\nFruit Salad\nThis entree has been created especially for Lufthansa by the\nJeunes Restaurateurs d'Europe - Germany.\nRESTAURATEURS\nD'EUROPE\nEnglish\nEspañol\nGetränke / Beverages\n221C001-C\nPlease accept our apology if occasionally your selection is not available.\n5 221C001-C"
    ],
